        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<h4 id="热身赛（不要问我为什么5月的比赛现在才写），5题中主要D，E有点难度。"><a href="#热身赛（不要问我为什么5月的比赛现在才写），5题中主要D，E有点难度。" class="headerlink" title="热身赛（不要问我为什么5月的比赛现在才写），5题中主要D，E有点难度。"></a>热身赛（<del>不要问我为什么5月的比赛现在才写</del>），5题中主要D，E有点难度。</h4><h2 id="A-哈喽卧得"><a href="#A-哈喽卧得" class="headerlink" title="A 哈喽卧得"></a><strong>A</strong> 哈喽卧得</h2><h2 id="题目链接：A-哈喽卧得"><a href="#题目链接：A-哈喽卧得" class="headerlink" title="题目链接：A 哈喽卧得"></a>题目链接：<a href="https://fjnuacm.top/p/FJNUWA?tid=6a0c55a5534f17f90d4c3a11"><strong>A</strong> 哈喽卧得</a></h2><h3 id="解题思路"><a href="#解题思路" class="headerlink" title="解题思路"></a>解题思路</h3><p>如题，显然输出“Niceeeeeee”即可。</p><h4 id="代码实现："><a href="#代码实现：" class="headerlink" title="代码实现："></a>代码实现：</h4><h2 id=""><a href="#" class="headerlink" title=""></a><figure class="highlight c++"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="meta">#<span class="keyword">include</span><span class="string">&lt;bits/stdc++.h&gt;</span></span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">using</span> <span class="keyword">namespace</span> std;</span><br><span class="line"><span class="function"><span class="type">int</span> <span class="title">main</span><span class="params">()</span></span>&#123;</span><br><span class="line">    cout&lt;&lt;<span class="string">&quot;Niceeeeeee&quot;</span>;</span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></h2><h2 id="B-石头剪刀布"><a href="#B-石头剪刀布" class="headerlink" title="B 石头剪刀布"></a><strong>B</strong> 石头剪刀布</h2><h2 id="题目链接：B-石头剪刀布"><a href="#题目链接：B-石头剪刀布" class="headerlink" title="题目链接：B 石头剪刀布"></a>题目链接：<a href="https://fjnuacm.top/p/FJNUWB?tid=6a0c55a5534f17f90d4c3a11"><strong>B</strong> 石头剪刀布</a></h2><h3 id="解题思路-1"><a href="#解题思路-1" class="headerlink" title="解题思路"></a>解题思路</h3><p>答案为Rock、Scissors、Paper 三者中的一个，随便输入都有33.33333333% 的概率通过本题。</p><h4 id="绝望时刻："><a href="#绝望时刻：" class="headerlink" title="绝望时刻："></a>绝望时刻：</h4><p><img src="/img/22rs_1.png" alt="绝望时刻"></p><h4 id="代码实现：-1"><a href="#代码实现：-1" class="headerlink" title="代码实现："></a>代码实现：</h4><h2 id="-1"><a href="#-1" class="headerlink" title=""></a><figure class="highlight c++"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="meta">#<span class="keyword">include</span><span class="string">&lt;bits/stdc++.h&gt;</span></span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">using</span> <span class="keyword">namespace</span> std;</span><br><span class="line"><span class="function"><span class="type">int</span> <span class="title">main</span><span class="params">()</span></span>&#123;</span><br><span class="line">    cout&lt;&lt;<span class="string">&quot;Rock&quot;</span>;</span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></h2><h2 id="C-数织"><a href="#C-数织" class="headerlink" title="C 数织"></a><strong>C</strong> 数织</h2><h2 id="题目链接：C-数织"><a href="#题目链接：C-数织" class="headerlink" title="题目链接：C 数织"></a>题目链接：<a href="https://fjnuacm.top/p/FJNUWC?tid=6a0c55a5534f17f90d4c3a11"><strong>C</strong> 数织</a></h2><h3 id="解题思路：我不会，赛场上写了一个小时，终于写出来，队友上交的时候打错了。好绝望啊。"><a href="#解题思路：我不会，赛场上写了一个小时，终于写出来，队友上交的时候打错了。好绝望啊。" class="headerlink" title="解题思路：我不会，赛场上写了一个小时，终于写出来，队友上交的时候打错了。好绝望啊。"></a>解题思路：我不会，赛场上写了一个小时，终于写出来，队友上交的时候打错了。好绝望啊。</h3><h3 id="代码实现：-2"><a href="#代码实现：-2" class="headerlink" title="代码实现："></a>代码实现：</h3><h2 id="-2"><a href="#-2" class="headerlink" title=""></a><figure class="highlight c++"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br><span class="line">19</span><br><span class="line">20</span><br><span class="line">21</span><br><span class="line">22</span><br><span class="line">23</span><br><span class="line">24</span><br><span class="line">25</span><br><span class="line">26</span><br><span class="line">27</span><br><span class="line">28</span><br><span class="line">29</span><br><span class="line">30</span><br><span class="line">31</span><br><span class="line">32</span><br><span class="line">33</span><br><span class="line">34</span><br><span class="line">35</span><br><span class="line">36</span><br><span class="line">37</span><br><span class="line">38</span><br><span class="line">39</span><br><span class="line">40</span><br><span class="line">41</span><br><span class="line">42</span><br><span class="line">43</span><br><span class="line">44</span><br><span class="line">45</span><br><span class="line">46</span><br><span class="line">47</span><br><span class="line">48</span><br><span class="line">49</span><br><span class="line">50</span><br><span class="line">51</span><br><span class="line">52</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="meta">#<span class="keyword">include</span><span class="string">&lt;bits/stdc++.h&gt;</span></span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">using</span> <span class="keyword">namespace</span> std;</span><br><span class="line"><span class="function"><span class="type">int</span> <span class="title">main</span><span class="params">()</span></span>&#123;</span><br><span class="line">cout&lt;&lt;<span class="string">&quot;..#.......&quot;</span>&lt;&lt;endl;</span><br><span class="line">cout&lt;&lt;<span class="string">&quot;###.#.....&quot;</span>&lt;&lt;endl;</span><br><span class="line">cout&lt;&lt;<span class="string">&quot;###.##...#&quot;</span>&lt;&lt;endl;</span><br><span class="line">cout&lt;&lt;<span class="string">&quot;###.###...&quot;</span>&lt;&lt;endl;</span><br><span class="line">cout&lt;&lt;<span class="string">&quot;###.##....&quot;</span>&lt;&lt;endl;</span><br><span class="line">cout&lt;&lt;<span class="string">&quot;#..###..#.&quot;</span>&lt;&lt;endl;</span><br><span class="line">cout&lt;&lt;<span class="string">&quot;#####.####&quot;</span>&lt;&lt;endl;</span><br><span class="line">cout&lt;&lt;<span class="string">&quot;.#.#..####&quot;</span>&lt;&lt;endl;</span><br><span class="line">cout&lt;&lt;<span class="string">&quot;......####&quot;</span>&lt;&lt;endl;</span><br><span class="line">cout&lt;&lt;<span class="string">&quot;.....##.##&quot;</span>&lt;&lt;endl;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">cout&lt;&lt;<span class="string">&quot;#....######....&quot;</span>&lt;&lt;endl;</span><br><span class="line">cout&lt;&lt;<span class="string">&quot;......#####....&quot;</span>&lt;&lt;endl;</span><br><span class="line">cout&lt;&lt;<span class="string">&quot;......######...&quot;</span>&lt;&lt;endl;</span><br><span class="line">cout&lt;&lt;<span class="string">&quot;........####...&quot;</span>&lt;&lt;endl;</span><br><span class="line">cout&lt;&lt;<span class="string">&quot;.......###.#...&quot;</span>&lt;&lt;endl;</span><br><span class="line">cout&lt;&lt;<span class="string">&quot;#####....#....#&quot;</span>&lt;&lt;endl;</span><br><span class="line">cout&lt;&lt;<span class="string">&quot;######.##......&quot;</span>&lt;&lt;endl;</span><br><span class="line">cout&lt;&lt;<span class="string">&quot;######..###....&quot;</span>&lt;&lt;endl;</span><br><span class="line">cout&lt;&lt;<span class="string">&quot;##...########..&quot;</span>&lt;&lt;endl;</span><br><span class="line">cout&lt;&lt;<span class="string">&quot;....##...######&quot;</span>&lt;&lt;endl;</span><br><span class="line">cout&lt;&lt;<span class="string">&quot;.....#...#####.&quot;</span>&lt;&lt;endl;</span><br><span class="line">cout&lt;&lt;<span class="string">&quot;....#....######&quot;</span>&lt;&lt;endl;</span><br><span class="line">cout&lt;&lt;<span class="string">&quot;######...###.#.&quot;</span>&lt;&lt;endl;</span><br><span class="line">cout&lt;&lt;<span class="string">&quot;######..####.##&quot;</span>&lt;&lt;endl;</span><br><span class="line">cout&lt;&lt;<span class="string">&quot;######..####...&quot;</span>&lt;&lt;endl;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">cout&lt;&lt;<span class="string">&quot;###...#######......#&quot;</span>&lt;&lt;endl;</span><br><span class="line">cout&lt;&lt;<span class="string">&quot;#####...#####......#&quot;</span>&lt;&lt;endl;</span><br><span class="line">cout&lt;&lt;<span class="string">&quot;#####...#.#.####...#&quot;</span>&lt;&lt;endl;</span><br><span class="line">cout&lt;&lt;<span class="string">&quot;#####.....#######.##&quot;</span>&lt;&lt;endl;</span><br><span class="line">cout&lt;&lt;<span class="string">&quot;#.....###.#.####...#&quot;</span>&lt;&lt;endl;</span><br><span class="line">cout&lt;&lt;<span class="string">&quot;#.....###.####.#...#&quot;</span>&lt;&lt;endl;</span><br><span class="line">cout&lt;&lt;<span class="string">&quot;#.....###...##....##&quot;</span>&lt;&lt;endl;</span><br><span class="line">cout&lt;&lt;<span class="string">&quot;#########.#.###..###&quot;</span>&lt;&lt;endl;</span><br><span class="line">cout&lt;&lt;<span class="string">&quot;##...##.########..#.&quot;</span>&lt;&lt;endl;</span><br><span class="line">cout&lt;&lt;<span class="string">&quot;##....#.##########..&quot;</span>&lt;&lt;endl;</span><br><span class="line">cout&lt;&lt;<span class="string">&quot;##....#######.###...&quot;</span>&lt;&lt;endl;</span><br><span class="line">cout&lt;&lt;<span class="string">&quot;......#..###...#....&quot;</span>&lt;&lt;endl;</span><br><span class="line">cout&lt;&lt;<span class="string">&quot;...#.###..#......###&quot;</span>&lt;&lt;endl;</span><br><span class="line">cout&lt;&lt;<span class="string">&quot;...#.#.#........####&quot;</span>&lt;&lt;endl;</span><br><span class="line">cout&lt;&lt;<span class="string">&quot;...#########....####&quot;</span>&lt;&lt;endl;</span><br><span class="line">cout&lt;&lt;<span class="string">&quot;....###...###....#..&quot;</span>&lt;&lt;endl;</span><br><span class="line">cout&lt;&lt;<span class="string">&quot;....###.............&quot;</span>&lt;&lt;endl;</span><br><span class="line">cout&lt;&lt;<span class="string">&quot;....###..........#..&quot;</span>&lt;&lt;endl;</span><br><span class="line">cout&lt;&lt;<span class="string">&quot;..#######....#....##&quot;</span>&lt;&lt;endl;</span><br><span class="line">cout&lt;&lt;<span class="string">&quot;..#.#####.####...###&quot;</span>&lt;&lt;endl;</span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></h2><h2 id="D-星穹秘库的启封之钥"><a href="#D-星穹秘库的启封之钥" class="headerlink" title="D 星穹秘库的启封之钥"></a><strong>D</strong> 星穹秘库的启封之钥</h2><h2 id="题目链接：D-星穹秘库的启封之钥"><a href="#题目链接：D-星穹秘库的启封之钥" class="headerlink" title="题目链接：D 星穹秘库的启封之钥"></a>题目链接：<a href="https://fjnuacm.top/p/FJNUWD?tid=6a0c55a5534f17f90d4c3a11"><strong>D</strong> 星穹秘库的启封之钥</a></h2><h3 id="解题思路-2"><a href="#解题思路-2" class="headerlink" title="解题思路"></a>解题思路</h3><p>根据规则二，即：m 除以 a 的余数，与 m 除以 b 的余数必须完全相同可知为求最小公倍数。</p><h3 id="代码实现：-3"><a href="#代码实现：-3" class="headerlink" title="代码实现："></a>代码实现：</h3><h2 id="-3"><a href="#-3" class="headerlink" title=""></a><figure class="highlight c++"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="meta">#<span class="keyword">include</span> <span class="string">&lt;bits/stdc++.h&gt;</span></span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">using</span> <span class="keyword">namespace</span> std;</span><br><span class="line"><span class="function"><span class="type">int</span> <span class="title">main</span><span class="params">()</span></span>&#123;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="type">long</span> <span class="type">long</span> a,b;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="type">int</span> t;</span><br><span class="line">    cin&gt;&gt;t;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">while</span>(t--)&#123;</span><br><span class="line">        cin&gt;&gt;a&gt;&gt;b;</span><br><span class="line">        cout&lt;&lt;<span class="built_in">lcm</span>(a,b)&lt;&lt;<span class="string">&#x27;\n&#x27;</span>;</span><br><span class="line">    &#125;</span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></h2><h2 id="E-双生魔咒"><a href="#E-双生魔咒" class="headerlink" title="E 双生魔咒"></a><strong>E</strong> 双生魔咒</h2><h2 id="题目链接：E-双生魔咒"><a href="#题目链接：E-双生魔咒" class="headerlink" title="题目链接：E 双生魔咒"></a>题目链接：<a href="https://fjnuacm.top/p/FJNUWE?tid=6a0c55a5534f17f90d4c3a11"><strong>E</strong> 双生魔咒</a></h2><h3 id="核心考点："><a href="#核心考点：" class="headerlink" title="核心考点："></a>核心考点：</h3><pre><code>数据结构：字典树（Trie）算法思想：贡献法，贪心，字典序</code></pre><h3 id="解题思路："><a href="#解题思路：" class="headerlink" title="解题思路："></a>解题思路：</h3><p>题目要求将 <code>2n</code> 个字符串均分为 <code>n</code> 个“引”和 <code>n</code> 个“根”，并求出所有 <code>n * n</code> 对字符串的 LCP 长度之和。<br>贡献法：<br>单独看每一对字符串的话，实际上计算是非常复杂的。借助字典树看，两个字符串的 LCP 长度，本质上就是它们在字典树上<strong>共同经过的非根节点数量</strong>。“所有配对的 LCP 之和”等价于“字典树上每个节点被合法配对共同经过的次数之和”。<br>贪心：<br>假设字典树上的某个节点 <code>p</code> 被 <code>cnt[p]</code> 个字符串经过。我们需要把这 <code>cnt[p]</code> 个串分为两部分，即“根”和“引”，假设有a1个根，a2个引，那么，显然有：<br><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">a1 + a2 = cnt[p]</span><br><span class="line">节点p上的合法配对数为：a1*a2</span><br><span class="line">据均值不等式，当a1==a2，a1*a2最大</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><br>所以最优解是将其平分。</p><h3 id="代码实现：-4"><a href="#代码实现：-4" class="headerlink" title="代码实现："></a>代码实现：</h3><figure class="highlight c++"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br><span class="line">19</span><br><span class="line">20</span><br><span class="line">21</span><br><span class="line">22</span><br><span class="line">23</span><br><span class="line">24</span><br><span class="line">25</span><br><span class="line">26</span><br><span class="line">27</span><br><span class="line">28</span><br><span class="line">29</span><br><span class="line">30</span><br><span class="line">31</span><br><span class="line">32</span><br><span class="line">33</span><br><span class="line">34</span><br><span class="line">35</span><br><span class="line">36</span><br><span class="line">37</span><br><span class="line">38</span><br><span class="line">39</span><br><span class="line">40</span><br><span class="line">41</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="comment">//字典树</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="meta">#<span class="keyword">include</span> <span class="string">&lt;bits/stdc++.h&gt;</span></span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">using</span> <span class="keyword">namespace</span> std;</span><br><span class="line"><span class="type">const</span> <span class="type">int</span> N = <span class="number">2e5</span><span class="number">+10</span>;</span><br><span class="line"><span class="type">const</span> <span class="type">int</span> M = <span class="number">26</span>;</span><br><span class="line"><span class="meta">#<span class="keyword">define</span> ll long long</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="type">int</span> tr[N][M];</span><br><span class="line"><span class="type">int</span> cnt[N];</span><br><span class="line"><span class="type">int</span> tot;</span><br><span class="line"><span class="function"><span class="type">int</span> <span class="title">get_id</span><span class="params">(<span class="type">char</span> c)</span></span>&#123;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">return</span> c-<span class="string">&#x27;a&#x27;</span>;</span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br><span class="line"><span class="function"><span class="type">int</span> <span class="title">main</span><span class="params">()</span></span>&#123;</span><br><span class="line">    std::ios::<span class="built_in">sync_with_stdio</span>(<span class="literal">false</span>);</span><br><span class="line">    std::cin.<span class="built_in">tie</span>(<span class="number">0</span>);</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="type">int</span> n;</span><br><span class="line">    cin&gt;&gt;n;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">for</span>(<span class="type">int</span> i=<span class="number">1</span>;i&lt;=<span class="number">2</span>*n;i++)&#123;</span><br><span class="line">        string s;</span><br><span class="line">        cin&gt;&gt;s;</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="type">int</span> p=<span class="number">0</span>; <span class="comment">// p=0 代表字典树的虚拟根节点</span></span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">for</span>(<span class="type">char</span> c:s)&#123;</span><br><span class="line">            <span class="type">int</span> u = <span class="built_in">get_id</span>(c); <span class="comment">// 将 a-z 映射为 0-25</span></span><br><span class="line">            <span class="keyword">if</span>(!tr[p][u])&#123; <span class="comment">// 如果当前节点 p 没有走向字符 u 的子节点，则开辟新节点</span></span><br><span class="line">                tr[p][u] = ++tot;</span><br><span class="line">            &#125;</span><br><span class="line">            <span class="comment">// 经过节点 p 的字符串数量 +1 </span></span><br><span class="line">            <span class="comment">// 记录贡献</span></span><br><span class="line">            p=tr[p][u];</span><br><span class="line">            cnt[p]++;</span><br><span class="line">        &#125; </span><br><span class="line">    &#125;</span><br><span class="line">    ll ans=<span class="number">0</span>;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">for</span>(<span class="type">int</span> i=<span class="number">1</span>;i&lt;=tot;i++)&#123;</span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment">// 贪心，将经过该节点的 cnt[i] 个字符串均分</span></span><br><span class="line">        ll a1=cnt[i]/<span class="number">2</span>;</span><br><span class="line">        ll a2=cnt[i]-a1;</span><br><span class="line">        ans+=a1*a2;</span><br><span class="line">    &#125;</span><br><span class="line">    cout&lt;&lt;ans&lt;&lt;endl;</span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>]]></content>
      
      
